/*
What an importer emits row by row. The second `::bg` takes Tomas off stage, so
his next line is W-STAGE-ABSENT. `lute.project.yaml` sets that code `off` for
`scenes/imported/**` while the port is reviewed; the fix, once reviewed, is a
`::showSpeaker` after the `::bg`, as scenes/cafe.lute does before its first line.
*/

